          "text": "I understand your concern. Misleading content is a real problem. In this video, I used one AI-generated clip (about 4 seconds) only because no clear real footage existed for that moment—it was meant as a visual aid, not deception. The rest is real footage and research. I take accuracy seriously.\n\nThat said, I agree with you—the AI clip only gives a general idea. The real scene was far more intense. But since no clean footage exists from that exact event, I used AI to help viewers picture the scale. If you have actual footage from that moment, I'd genuinely love to see it.",
